{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Fast and Fluid Combat</strong> <br>Switch skills freely in this fast-paced action roguelike with responsive controls and impactful hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756400/extras/Desc_1.gif?t=1748449897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Build Your Own Deck</strong> <br>Absorb enemy powers and mix skills and passives to shape your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756400/extras/Desc_2.gif?t=1748449897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Every Run Feels New</strong> <br>No two runs are the same\u2014explore new builds and enjoy fresh challenges every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756400/extras/Desc_3.gif?t=1748449897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea7\u00a0<strong>Limitations of the Demo Version</strong><br>The demo offers full access to the core gameplay experience.\u00a0You can play the <strong>first stage of each run</strong>, exploring the beginning of three different themed zones.<br>Local save is supported, but <strong>progress will not carry over to the full version</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will feature <strong>three stages per run</strong>, along with rich out-of-run features such as <strong>card collection</strong>, <strong>starting deck customization</strong>, battle records, and character outfit changes.<br>These features are not available in the demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756400?t=1748449897","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag